### AccessIQ API Reference
### Base URL: http://localhost:3001

## ============================================================
## Health Check
## ============================================================

### Health Check
GET http://localhost:3001/api/health

## ============================================================
## Targets
## ============================================================

### List all targets with latest scan summary
GET http://localhost:3001/api/targets

### Add a new target
POST http://localhost:3001/api/targets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://india.gov.in",
  "siteName": "National Portal of India",
  "siteType": "central-govt",
  "country": "India"
}

### Add demo page targets
POST http://localhost:3001/api/targets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "http://localhost:3001/demo/before.html",
  "siteName": "Demo Before (Violations)",
  "siteType": "demo-page",
  "country": "India"
}

###
POST http://localhost:3001/api/targets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "http://localhost:3001/demo/after.html",
  "siteName": "Demo After (Remediated)",
  "siteType": "demo-page",
  "country": "India"
}

## ============================================================
## Scans
## ============================================================

### Trigger a new scan (replace scanTargetId with actual ID)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/scans
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scanTargetId": "REPLACE_WITH_TARGET_ID"
}

### Check scan job status (replace with actual jobId)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/scans/REPLACE_WITH_JOB_ID/status

### Get full scan result (replace with actual scan result ID)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/scans/REPLACE_WITH_SCAN_ID

### Compare two scans (replace with actual scan IDs)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/scans/REPLACE_WITH_BEFORE_ID/compare/REPLACE_WITH_AFTER_ID

## ============================================================
## Dashboard
## ============================================================

### Dashboard summary
GET http://localhost:3001/api/dashboard/summary

### Benchmark comparison (WebAIM Million data)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/dashboard/benchmark
